  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nThe implementation computes **NoPE Layer** by following direct architectural principles, leveraging vectorized operations to ensure both correctness and optimal runtime efficiency.\n\n### ⚡ Python Reference Implementation\n```python\nimport numpy as np\ndef solution(q, k):\n    # No positional rotation is applied; return the inputs unchanged.\n    return {\"q\":np.asarray(q).tolist(),\"k\":np.asarray(k).tolist()}\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ where $N$ represents the primary sequence length or dimension.\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ auxiliary memory for computing and storing output representations.",
